  "name": "Haze (Su)",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>It is much more difficult to notice or clearly focus one's interest upon a 3rd-level illusionist, imposing a -2 penalty to Perception checks against the character. This penalty applies in all situations, including when trying to see through an illusion that allows for such a roll or even a disguise, even if the illusionist isn't actively trying to avoid the perception or maintain a facade. This penalty increases by -1 for every 2 levels of illusionist attained after 3rd level (-3 at 5th, -4 at 7th, -5 at 9th, -6 at 11th, -7 at 13th, -8 at 15th, -9 at 17th, -10 at 19th).</p>",
